# ANCESTRY_MAP template (copy to your own path, set ANCESTRY_MAP to point at
# it, then fill in real snp_input paths). Tab-separated, no header.
# Column 1: ancestry label - MUST exactly match the population-label column
#           in your reference panel's .psam (ANCESTRY_REF_LABEL_COL).
# Column 2: snp_input path - same xlsx/csv/tsv format SNP_INPUT already
#           accepts (rsID + risk/effect allele [+ weight] columns).
# Lines starting with # (like this one) are skipped.
#EUR	/path/to/eur_snp_input.tsv
#EAS	/path/to/eas_snp_input.tsv
#SAS	/path/to/sas_snp_input.tsv
#AFR	/path/to/afr_snp_input.tsv
